Rationale: makes the gate meaningfully refutable. Both consumers import the SAME in-tree package, so a constant bump moves them together and a naive gate is always green. The gate compares the independent compat-manifest pin against the artifact the package actually exports (require(dist), TS-source fallback), plus contracts version, dependency declaration and consumer import sites. RED proven both directions (source=2; pin=2), GREEN restored.
Privacy & security: reads local files only; no network, no credentials. The implementation-free regression test greps package src for function/arrow/class/uuidUtils/crypto/fs/NestJS.
